<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets 10 bln escuodo 10-yr bond. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets 10 bln escuodo 10-yr bond. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects currency in headline from peseta.)</p>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BanCisf and Caixa Geral de Depositos.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE (FREDDIE MAC)</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTE    COUPON    *6.50	MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     MOODY	AAA	 LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW    NEW YORK</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN 13.0 PCT MINUS 12-MONTH</p>
<p>		LISBOR (MINIMUM COUPON 4.0 PCT) IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
